type: software
title: "physAI-QA-interactive: an interactive visualization and annotation tool for physiological recordings in BIDS fMRI datasets"
abstract: >-
  physAI-QA-interactive is a browser-based tool for exploring and annotating
  physiological recordings in BIDS fMRI datasets. It lets researchers step
  through every scan of a dataset, view physiological signals alongside
  fMRIPrep motion confounds, compute per-channel signal quality metrics, and
  annotate artifacts in place, saving the annotations next to the dataset.
  It is the first released tool of physAI-QA, the quality assurance
  component of the physAI research suite.
